    "sub_name": "微水力發電設計思考工作坊",
    "sub_ename": "MICRO-HYDROPOWER DESIGN THINKING WORKSHOP",
    "describe_ch": "本課程是以設計思考工作坊的辦理方式，課程內容包含微水力發電的原理、案例、現場勘查與團體討論，並邀請業界技師參與授課，以兩天密集授課方式，讓學生在設計思考授課裡面中，瞭解水力發電。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is conducted as a design thinking workshop. The curriculum covers the principles of micro-hydropower, case studies, site surveys, and group discussions. Featuring instruction from industry professionals, this two-day intensive program enables students to understand micro-hydropower within a design thinking framework.",
